# Contexte de build = RACINE du depot (services api et web).
# N'inclure que le necessaire : pipeline/, apps/api|web, requirements. Exclure venvs, caches,
# artefacts de benchmark et SECRETS (.env) — sinon le contexte embarque plusieurs Go (torch).
.git
.gitignore
.github
.venv
.harness
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.uv-cache
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
node_modules
**/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/playwright-report
benchmarks
logs
*.db
*.sqlite
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
CHANGELOG.md
README.md
